<title>UK: EBRD lends 105 mln marks to Croat bank.</title>
<headline>EBRD lends 105 mln marks to Croat bank.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Bank for Reconstruction and Development said it will lend 105 million marks to the Croatian Bank for Reconstruction and Development for environmental projects.</p>
<p>The loan will be used to finance water utilities along the Adriatic coast in a 320 million mark project backed by foreign donors, including the World Bank. -- David Chance London newsroom 44 171 542 5887</p>
</text>
